# Generated by daemon (infrastructure/convention-sync). Do not hand-edit.
#
# Append-only logs: both sides only ever ADD lines, so "keep both" is always the
# right answer. Without this a rebase conflicts on them and the PR stops moving.
#
# NOW.md is deliberately NOT here (D-0118 rule 3). It declares itself "Rewritten,
# not appended", so a union of two rewrites yields a doubled front door: complete
# looking, silently wrong, read first by every session. A NOW.md divergence is
# resolved by re-reading origin's copy and rewriting it.
STATUS.md     merge=union
CHANGES.md    merge=union
DECISIONS.md  merge=union
